  "title": "Gluten-Free Egg-free Oatmeal Chocolate Chip and Raisin Cookies",
  "description": "These moist and rich chocolate cookies, enriched with oatmeal and raisins, are a delicious alternative for an egg-free and gluten-free diet.",
  "authors": [
